<title>JAPAN: TIFFE euroyen ends down but off low on BOJ comment.</title>
<headline>TIFFE euroyen ends down but off low on BOJ comment.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>July 14 settlement  prev settlement</p>
<p> TIFFE Euroyen 3M (H)     99.01		   99.03</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>The key March three-month euroyen futures contract ended down, but off the day's low on Monday, as a speech by the Bank of Japan governor in the morning contained no surprises, traders said.</p>
<p>The March was sold in the early morning on speculation that BOJ governor Yasuo Matsushita may unveil a more optimistic view of the economy than before, in his opening speech at a BOJ branch managers' meeting, traders said.</p>
